1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
一碗粉，闻着臭，吃着上瘾
Smells foul — tastes addictive

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,400
柳州螺蛳粉，臭的其实是酸笋
Liuzhou luosifen — the stink is sour bamboo

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,600
鲜笋泡进山泉，慢慢发酵
Fresh shoots, spring water, slow ferment

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:08,800
这口酸笋，是整碗的灵魂
This sour shoot is the whole soul

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,000
螺蛳熬汤：鲜、辣、酸、爽
Snail broth: fresh, hot, sour, brisk

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,200
米粉滑弹，一嗦到底
Slick rice noodles — slurp to the bottom

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,400
2021年，列入国家级非遗
2021: national intangible heritage

8
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,600
从路边摊，到一包寄全国
Street stall to a bag shipped nationwide

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,800
一碗粉，全产业链七百多亿
One bowl — a 76-billion-yuan chain

10
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:22,000
越臭越爱，这就是螺蛳粉
The stinkier, the better — that's luosifen

11
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,400
你敢嗦吗？下集：麻辣收尾那碗
Dare to slurp? Next: the mala finale
